  "bodyHash": "0wQtBPZEnQU=",
  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_4b27a9e4-8414-4d22-bb39-268eebd99129.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1082\" height=\"137\"></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:793px;display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QW3HqoWXRFg?t=21s\" width=\"793\" height=\"464\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_8f44d6cd-1169-4d2d-9511-b5ef389b18a4.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\"></strong></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Arda的Sculk模組是一個能讓你透過強化遊戲中的Sculk來製作更強大工具和物品的模組。</strong></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1.4及以上版本需要</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>GECKOLIB</strong></a><strong>。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 模組 -</strong></h1><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_55965104-f602-4470-a603-b3ecb63ccd4a.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_6de15eb4-13de-4a66-b669-df765ce41cae.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>全新傳送門</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">遊戲中新增了一個傳送門，你可以製作一個傳送門點火器，利用從古城收集到的新材料來開啟這個古老傳送門。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>古老世界：</strong>要進入這個維度，需要<strong>古老世界傳送門點火器</strong>物品。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_4d9c1c2c-050b-479c-8b5c-baa0426a7232.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿花</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">新增了許多花朵和植物，你可以在遊戲中用作裝飾和光源。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_9e8b95fa-bb7f-4139-918b-726e60d17cd4.png\"></strong></h3>\n<div>\n<h1><strong>古城礦石</strong></h1>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_c5246a13-0b0d-46b1-a25f-08b2877a5b7b.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_34a701e5-29aa-47a2-a43e-fead4b9d5218.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>新戰利品</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">遊戲中新增了更多新物品，包括幽匿合金升級模板，可以在古城的箱子中找到。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e7154663-0921-4958-a706-e42c4dff2ccb.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_bc0c0567-3cdc-4ecb-ab65-228f525df182.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_23463e01-80c6-43fb-8951-85de0964145d.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿傀儡</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">在新的首領區域，你可以與幽匿傀儡首領戰鬥，並用它掉落的幽匿水晶製作新的幽匿合金多功能工具！</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_ff537b25-edec-407c-84ba-5e9a7ca026ce.png\"></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_fc741a09-dd2d-48cf-96fd-edab0890f7f5.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>暗影獵手</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_44fc05ba-dd0b-410a-a13d-87fcf89a4d33.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_f00db0a4-80df-4f05-94d5-db9dcfbc0da5.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_93d053d1-63d9-410a-97bb-71701e28ded5.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_959ff98e-4c38-4cc1-8e59-364dba172f2b.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>輻射守衛</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_b40fdda4-6413-4979-bc77-18f3cf9a7cd6.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76fd5e0f-bfda-4bf5-a466-3630603d5623.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿手臂</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">新增的幽匿手臂將賦予你像守衛一樣強大的拳頭，這些幽匿手臂是用從古城箱子和生物獲得的材料製作的。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_b2a99088-58fa-4896-936a-eb1539792919.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1fc8c2bd-6f35-4e5f-b726-b38c1e41c56e.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿合金物品！</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">繼獄髓之後，新增的強大幽匿合金工具。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_9fd7e796-35b1-42bc-ac15-1b37312ec27a.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2c7d7561-842a-4854-9a5b-2a25e18da36e.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>靈魂幽匿平原</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">地上的草與普通的幽匿草相比會減慢生物的速度，而位於周圍的靈魂感測器可以進一步減慢玩家的速度。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_ec846fa0-ce1b-47e0-a044-940c96926477.png\"></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿平原</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">它們是新維度中的平坦區域。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e6020889-c83c-4c99-bcde-eef4c0c761c1.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>黑樺木森林</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">這是一個危險的生態域，在茂密的樹木間生活著一種吱吱作響的生物。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_605904f1-61a8-4013-95c9-413b4960fce9.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿沙漠</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">這些是乾旱區域，沒有樹木可以生產材料。我們周圍有古老的傳送門，可以讓我們返回正常世界。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e3c8c116-1afb-45fe-b727-99c12dad42c1.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>紫藤森林</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">這是一個被岩石環繞的生態域，這裡的樹木比其他生態域更美麗多彩。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_b7df097e-32a4-454f-96fe-4c1686b9676d.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿森林</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">幽匿森林是幽匿平原生態域的變體，有更多的樹木和更少的骨頭。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_414f0aa3-7617-4e67-952c-ad94e85f4990.png\"></h1>\n<h1><strong>輻射輕木森林</strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_eda60703-423f-477f-b5dc-00d32d854590.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_fa8da897-79e7-499b-bfa8-5ef103658cc1.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿木套裝</strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"1205\" height=\"75\"></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1ac01893-6955-4624-b41f-fb1e1354280a.png\"></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>黑樺木套裝</strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e8e70767-1c3b-45f4-b2ee-6eceaf3b058a.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;紫藤木套裝</strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 版本資訊 -</strong></h1><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-1.21.1</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-1.20.1</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-此版本是將 Arda's Sculks 1.4.3.3 從 1.21.1 降級至 1.20.1 的版本。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-結構中不會有寶箱戰利品，且可能存在許多錯誤。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-這些錯誤將不會被修復，開發重點將放在新版本上。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 已知問題 -</strong></h1><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p>（若我的模組在 Minecraft 伺服器上崩潰，請確保您已安裝 geckolib，因為若未安裝，模組將會崩潰而不會顯示警告！）<br><br>- 除了少數紋理錯誤外，我未發現任何影響遊戲體驗的錯誤。<br><br>- 若您使用 1.20.1 版本，可能會遇到許多錯誤，因為 1.20.1 版本是透過降級 1.21.1 版本所新增的，我已盡力修復這些錯誤。</p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 翻譯貢獻 -</strong></h1><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_fe5a94ce-ebdd-42b1-a135-92ba73b9d529.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"> &nbsp;<strong>Arda Ayd. (Ixra) :&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fixraplayer.github.io%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ixraplayer.github.io/</a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_a2dea3a6-e9b8-4156-893d-ab1be0a5e019.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><strong>&nbsp; Iago Emanuel</strong> :&nbsp; <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://iagoemanuel.weebly.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://iagoemanuel.weebly.com/</a></h1>\n</div><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">您可以在模組包中使用我的模組。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">關於模組的詳細資訊請參閱：「<a href=\"https://github.com/IxraPlayer/Ardas-Sculks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/IxraPlayer/Ardas-Sculks</a>」</p>",
